OL,3,GNEWSAPM backs mayor and devolution
OL,4,Aplans in Wessex region
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mayor for the Wessex region appears
OL,7,Fto be a step closer after the prime
OL,8,Fminister said he was keen on a "fully
OL,9,Fdevolved south west of England".
OL,11,FWest Dorset MP Edward Morello raised
OL,12,Fconcerns in parliament about the area
OL,13,F"being left behind" over funding, by
OL,14,Fnot having a directly elected mayor.
OL,16,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham responded
OL,17,Fthat he wanted to move "quickly" on
OL,18,Fdevolution, offering to meet
OL,19,Fcouncillors from Dorset, Bournemouth,
OL,20,FChristchurch and Poole (BCP), Wiltshire
OL,21,Fand Somerset to discuss how the
OL,22,Fproposal could progress.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,335,330,200,160,0,100
