OL,3,GNEWSAPM backs mayor and devolution
OL,4,Aplans in Wessex region
OL,5,
OL,6,FLabour MPs in the region appear divided
OL,7,Fon the issue however, with Poole's Neil
OL,8,FDuncan-Jordan saying it would create an
OL,9,F"artificial entity" of urban and rural
OL,10,Fareas.
